    metadata blob. A JSON blob cannot be indexed portably across SQLite,
    MySQL, MariaDB, and PostgreSQL, and bounded listing queries are an exit
    criterion of this milestone: every filter the query API will expose has
    an index behind it, because an unindexed filter on a high-volume table
    is how observability tooling takes an application down.
    
